{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-feedbacks-api-01",
    "name": "Feedbacks API — Auth + Catálogo",
    "description": "Collection da API Quarkus (feedbacks-api).\n\n**Como usar**\n1. Suba a API em `http://localhost:8080` (profile `local`).\n2. Rode **Auth → Login (Estudante)** ou **Login (Admin)** — o script salva `accessToken` automaticamente.\n3. Como Admin: **Criar curso** → salva `cursoId`; **Criar aula** → salva `aulaId` (UJ-2).\n4. As rotas protegidas usam `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.\n\n**Usuários seed (Flyway V2)**\n- Estudante: `estudante@demo.fiap` / `senha123`\n- Admin: `admin@demo.fiap` / `admin123`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cursoId",
      "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
    },
    {
      "key": "aulaId",
      "value": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/health",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Health público do contrato (AD-9). Sem token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /q/health (SmallRye)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/q/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["q", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Health nativo SmallRye (liveness/readiness agregados)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Estudante)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('accessToken salvo (ESTUDANTE)');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"estudante@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login público. Em sucesso, grava `accessToken` na collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('accessToken salvo (ADMINISTRADOR)');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login como ADMINISTRADOR. Grava `accessToken` na collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — credenciais inválidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"estudante@demo.fiap\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-errada\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 com `code` = `AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS` e `traceId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — validação (400)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"nao-e-email\",\n  \"password\": \"123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 400 com `code` = `VALIDATION_ERROR`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cursos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar cursos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE ou ADMINISTRADOR. Lista persistida (criado_em ASC)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar curso por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/{{cursoId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos", "{{cursoId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE ou ADMINISTRADOR. Id inexistente → 404 CURSO_NOT_FOUND."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar curso (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('cursoId', json.id);",
                  "  console.log('cursoId salvo:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Curso Postman\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Criado via UJ-2\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ADMINISTRADOR. Salva `cursoId` no 201. Com token de Estudante → 403 AUTH_FORBIDDEN."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar aulas do curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/{{cursoId}}/aulas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos", "{{cursoId}}", "aulas"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE ou ADMINISTRADOR. Curso inexistente → 404 CURSO_NOT_FOUND."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar aula no curso (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('aulaId', json.id);",
                  "  console.log('aulaId salvo:', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Aula Postman\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Aula criada via UJ-2\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/{{cursoId}}/aulas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos", "{{cursoId}}", "aulas"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ADMINISTRADOR. Campo `nome` (não `titulo`). Salva `aulaId` no 201."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Inscrever em curso (Estudante)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/{{cursoId}}/inscricoes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos", "{{cursoId}}", "inscricoes"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE. Persiste inscrição no Curso (201 com id/cursoId/estudanteId). Duplicata → 409 INSCRICAO_DUPLICADA. Curso inexistente → 404 CURSO_NOT_FOUND. Admin → 403."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Inscrever em aula (Estudante)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/{{cursoId}}/aulas/{{aulaId}}/inscricoes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos", "{{cursoId}}", "aulas", "{{aulaId}}", "inscricoes"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE e inscrição prévia no Curso. 201 com id/cursoId/aulaId/estudanteId. Sem inscrição no Curso → 409 INSCRICAO_CURSO_OBRIGATORIA. Duplicata → 409 INSCRICAO_DUPLICADA."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Aulas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar aula por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/aulas/{{aulaId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "aulas", "{{aulaId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE ou ADMINISTRADOR. Id inexistente → 404 AULA_NOT_FOUND."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Avaliações",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar avaliações",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avaliacoes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "avaliacoes"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE ou ADMINISTRADOR. Estudante vê só as próprias."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar avaliação (Estudante)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"aulaId\": \"{{aulaId}}\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Feedback via Postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/avaliacoes",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "avaliacoes"]
            },
            "description": "Requer ESTUDANTE inscrito na Aula (FR-6). Sem inscrição → 403 INSCRICAO_AULA_OBRIGATORIA. Stub provisório (FR-7 completo no módulo Avaliação)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Erros de autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Rota protegida sem token (401 AUTH_MISSING_TOKEN)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 `AUTH_MISSING_TOKEN` com `traceId`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Token inválido (401 AUTH_INVALID_TOKEN)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "token-invalido",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos"]
            },
            "description": "Esperado: 401 `AUTH_INVALID_TOKEN`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forbidden — Estudante cria curso (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Não deveria criar\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "cursos"]
            },
            "description": "Faça login como Estudante antes. Esperado: 403 `AUTH_FORBIDDEN`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
